      "title": "How long are account verification emails and password reset emails valid?",
      "locale": "en-us",
      "label_names": [
        "mtpe",
        "ks",
        "ab0",
        "Support"
      ],
      "body": "<h2>Question</h2>\n<p>How long are account verification emails and password reset emails valid?</p>\n<h2>Answer </h2>\n<p>Both account verification emails and password reset emails expire after 24 hours. The <a href=\"https://support.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4408832398618\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">verification email can be resent</a> to the user, and the user can also <a href=\"https://support.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4408843565722\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">request a new password reset email</a> after it expires.</p>"
    },
